UnitClPoolTape::FetchStakedCumulativeAt
├── when the target timestamp is gte the current block timestamp
│   └── it returns the live secondsPerStakedLiquidityCumulativeX128 from the pool
└── when the target timestamp is lt the current block timestamp
    ├── when the target timestamp is lte the newest committed observation
    │   └── it returns the observation secondsPerStakedLiquidityCumulativeX128 value
    ├── when the target timestamp is lt the pool lastUpdated value
    │   ├── it interpolates between the observation value the settled value in the pool
    │   └── when the cumulative wrapped between the snapshot and the settlement
    │       └── it interpolates across the wrap
    └── when the target timestamp is gte the pool lastUpdated value
        ├── it interpolates between the settled value and the live secondsPerStakedLiquidityCumulativeX128 value
        └── when the staked liquidity never changed
            └── it lands on the projected value
